{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsuEXRoCgS1w5HGhFUpL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The result is identical to pass 9, down to the margin and stone counts, so practice games are deterministic for a given network. Re-running a network gives no new information, and every comparison between versions is one sample from a different trajectory. v8B stays the best observed.\n\nI'll use the remaining passes on careful variants of v8B. The first, v8C, adds the two clearly motivated tactical fixes to v8B's structure:\n- the corrected eye/near-eye unit, which blocks eye-fills next to atari chains when the rest of the group is uncertified (the 32-stone disaster);\n- the KO unit counting own atari neighbours, which avoids snapback-prone capture-saves.\n\n```python\nsrc=open('/work/build8.py').read()\nold=src[src.index(\"        u=NE+e; b[u]=2-deg\"):src.index(\"        u=KO+e\")]\nnew='''        u=NE+e; b[u]=-Q['ne_a']*deg+Q['ne_b']\n        for n in NB[e]:\n            W[OWN+n,u]+=Q['ne_a']; W[OPP+n,u]-=2*Q['ne_a']; W[AO+n,u]-=Q['ne_c']\n            # + ne_d * w,  w = OWN - AO - S3\n            W[OWN+n,u]+=Q['ne_d']; W[AO+n,u]-=Q['ne_d']; W[S3+n,u]-=Q['ne_d']\n'''\nsrc=src.replace(old,new)\nsrc=src.replace(\"        for n in NB[e]: W[OPP+n,u]+=1; W[NX0+n,u]-=1; W[NX1+n,u]-=1\",\n                \"        for n in NB[e]: W[OPP+n,u]+=1; W[NX0+n,u]-=1; W[NX1+n,u]-=1; W[AO+n,u]+=Q['ko_ao']\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"w_ne=25.0,\",\"w_ne=15.0,ne_a=3.0,ne_b=4.0,ne_c=4.0,ne_d=1.0,ko_ao=1.0,\")\nassert \"ko_ao']\" in src and \"ne_a\" in src\nopen('/work/build8c.py','w').write(src)\nexec(src)\nPB=dict(t1=2.5,W_o=0.3,prior={0:-2.0,1:1.0,2:1.6,3:0.8,4:1.0},prior_late={0:-1.0,1:0.3,2:0.6,3:0.4,4:0.4})\nT=build(PB)\nfor k,v in T.items(): save(k,v)\ni=src.index(\"        u=NE+e\"); print(src[i:i+900])\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":451399,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":665},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fea22f52-dc2f-44b9-a9cd-4bab4d2abe73","uuid":"dfde73f9-710b-46fa-891e-1244d703d26d","timestamp":"2026-11-09T19:25:10.254Z","request_id":"req_011CgsuETrEu9C96FakBZXBa"}
